 "_method": "rAF interval ring (__pyrefly.fx.stats), headless Chromium on the real GPU (RTX 5070 Ti, PYREFLY_BROWSER=gpu). Per chapter: 6 s at rest with A on, 6 s with A off (same page, fx.set), then the auto-battle: 8 s A off, 8 s A on. phone = 390x844, deviceScaleFactor 3 (A caps DPR at 1.5), CDP CPU throttle 4x; the GPU is still the desktop GPU. uncapped = --disable-gpu-vsync --disable-frame-rate-limit; it measures how fast frames are submitted (CPU side), not GPU completion, so read it as headroom only."
